  "name": "luh-cantilever-beam-dataset-for-structural-change-localisation",
  "notes": "The dataset contains measurement data, a numerical model, and identified modal properties of a cantilever beam structure. Different mass configurations were applied to the structure using magnetic attachments with varying positions and weights. In total, measurements with a duration of five minutes were conducted for 35 structural states. The dataset is designed for the application of model-based damage localisation approaches.\r\n",
